<title>INDIA: India to sell 20 bln rupees of five-yr bonds.</title>
<headline>India to sell 20 bln rupees of five-yr bonds.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Reserve Bank of India will auction 20 billion rupees' worth of five-year government bonds on November 26, the Finance Ministry said on Thursday.</p>
<p>It said in a statement that the securities would be eligible for the ready-forward facility.</p>
<p>- New Delhi newsroom +91-11 301 2024</p>
</text>
